#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:7
msgid "Activation"
msgstr "Activation"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:10
msgid "Enable DuckDB / MotherDuck"
msgstr "Activer DuckDB / MotherDuck"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:14
#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:137
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activé"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:18
msgid ""
"When enabled, MxChat uses this plugin as its vector store (in place of "
"Pinecone). When disabled, MxChat falls back to its default behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque activé, MxChat utilise ce plugin comme vector store (en lieu et "
"place de Pinecone). Si désactivé, MxChat retombe sur son comportement par "
"défaut."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:25
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "Backend"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:29
msgid "MotherDuck (cloud, via ATTACH)"
msgstr "MotherDuck (cloud, via ATTACH)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:33
msgid "DuckDB embedded (local file)"
msgstr "DuckDB embedded (fichier local)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:38
msgid "Default-bot routing"
msgstr "Routage du bot par défaut"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:44
msgid "Route default-bot Pinecone calls through this plugin (Option B reach)"
msgstr ""
"Router les appels Pinecone du bot par défaut via ce plugin (portée « Option "
"B »)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-activation.php:48
msgid ""
"MxChat reads its Pinecone settings straight from the database for the "
"default bot when the Multi-Bot Manager isn't active, which bypasses the "
"filter this plugin uses to advertise itself. Enable this to shortcircuit "
"that read and route default-bot calls through the proxy too. Leave OFF if "
"you're running real Pinecone alongside DuckDB on the default bot, or if "
"you've applied the upstream patch (Option A) — the patch path doesn't need "
"this setting."
msgstr ""
"Quand le Multi-Bot Manager n'est pas actif, MxChat lit les réglages Pinecone "
"du bot par défaut directement en base, ce qui contourne le filtre par lequel "
"ce plugin s'annonce. Activez cette option pour court-circuiter cette lecture "
"et router également les appels du bot par défaut via le proxy. Laissez-la "
"sur OFF si vous utilisez un vrai Pinecone à côté de DuckDB sur le bot par "
"défaut, ou si vous avez appliqué le patch amont (Option A) — le chemin "
"« patch » n'a pas besoin de ce réglage."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:24
msgid "Per-bot retrieval overrides"
msgstr "Surcharges de récupération par bot"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:27
msgid ""
"Tune retrieval per bot for multi-bot installs. Only hybrid search, dedup, "
"the query cache, and the slow-query threshold can vary per bot — backend and "
"storage are always shared. A bot with \"Override\" off inherits the global "
"Retrieval settings above. You can also set these from code with the "
"mxchat_plus_duckdb_bot_config filter."
msgstr ""
"Ajustez la récupération par bot pour les installations multi-bots. Seuls la "
"recherche hybride, la déduplication, le cache de requêtes et le seuil de "
"requête lente peuvent varier par bot — le backend et le stockage sont "
"toujours partagés. Un bot dont « Surcharger » est décoché hérite des "
"réglages de récupération globaux ci-dessus. Vous pouvez aussi les définir "
"par code via le filtre mxchat_plus_duckdb_bot_config."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:35
msgid ""
"No bots discovered yet — enable a backend and sync some content first, then "
"your bot IDs will appear here. (The default bot is \"default\".)"
msgstr ""
"Aucun bot détecté pour l'instant — activez un backend et synchronisez du "
"contenu, puis vos identifiants de bots apparaîtront ici. (Le bot par défaut "
"est « default ».)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:43
msgid "Bot"
msgstr "Bot"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:44
msgid "Override"
msgstr "Surcharger"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:45
msgid "Hybrid BM25"
msgstr "BM25 hybride"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:46
msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alpha"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:47
msgid "Dedup"
msgstr "Déduplication"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:48
#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:8
msgid "Query cache"
msgstr "Cache de requêtes"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:49
msgid "Cache TTL (s)"
msgstr "TTL du cache (s)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:50
msgid "Slow query (ms)"
msgstr "Requête lente (ms)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-bot-overrides.php:99
msgid ""
"Untick \"Override\" and Save to make a bot fall back to the global settings."
msgstr ""
"Décochez « Surcharger » et Enregistrez pour qu'un bot revienne aux réglages "
"globaux."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:9
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostics"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:12
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Tester la connexion"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:13
#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:19
msgid "Sync MySQL → DuckDB"
msgstr "Sync MySQL → DuckDB"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:14
#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:25
msgid "Reprocess all posts"
msgstr "Retraiter tous les posts"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:21
msgid ""
"copies the wp_mxchat_system_prompt_content table into DuckDB. Useful only if "
"MxChat is running in MySQL mode and the table contains embeddings."
msgstr ""
"copie la table wp_mxchat_system_prompt_content vers DuckDB. Utile uniquement "
"si MxChat tourne en mode MySQL et que la table contient les embeddings."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:27
msgid ""
"walks WordPress posts/pages and re-runs the MxChat ingestion pipeline "
"(chunking + embedding + upsert). Recommended for Pinecone-only installs. "
"Calls the configured embedding API (OpenAI / Voyage / Gemini) — potential "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"parcourt les posts/pages WordPress et relance le pipeline d'ingestion MxChat "
"(chunking + embedding + upsert). Recommandé pour les installations Pinecone-"
"only. Appelle l'API d'embedding configurée (OpenAI / Voyage / Gemini) — coût "
"potentiel."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:34
msgid "Post types to reprocess (comma-separated):"
msgstr "Post types à retraiter (séparés par virgule) :"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:48
msgid "Vectors in DuckDB"
msgstr "Vecteurs en DuckDB"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:61
msgid "Last sync"
msgstr "Dernière synchronisation"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:67
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s (%2$d vectors)"
msgstr "%1$s (%2$d vecteurs)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:72
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Jamais"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:78
msgid "Active backend"
msgstr "Backend actif"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:83
msgid "Searches (rolling 1h)"
msgstr "Recherches (1 h glissante)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:87
msgid "Latency p50 / p95 / p99"
msgstr "Latence p50 / p95 / p99"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:91
msgid "Cache hit rate"
msgstr "Taux de hit du cache"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:97
msgid "Pinecone proxy endpoint (Option B)"
msgstr "Endpoint du proxy Pinecone (Option B)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:100
msgid ""
"These values are auto-injected into MxChat via the "
"mxchat_get_bot_pinecone_config filter. No action required."
msgstr ""
"Ces valeurs sont injectées automatiquement dans MxChat via le filtre "
"mxchat_get_bot_pinecone_config. Aucune action n'est requise."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:107
msgid "Host (for MxChat)"
msgstr "Host (pour MxChat)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-diagnostics.php:111
msgid "Api-Key"
msgstr "Clé API"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-embedded.php:5
msgid "DuckDB embedded"
msgstr "DuckDB embedded"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-embedded.php:8
msgid "Path to the .duckdb file"
msgstr "Chemin du fichier .duckdb"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-embedded.php:15
msgid ""
"Leave empty to use the default wp-content/uploads/mxchat-plus-private/ "
"directory (protected by auto-generated .htaccess / web.config)."
msgstr ""
"Laisser vide pour utiliser le dossier par défaut wp-content/uploads/mxchat-"
"plus-private/ (protégé par un .htaccess / web.config générés "
"automatiquement)."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-embedded.php:20
msgid "DuckDB CLI binary"
msgstr "Binaire DuckDB CLI"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-embedded.php:27
msgid ""
"Used when the PHP duckdb extension is not installed. Leave empty for "
"autodetection."
msgstr ""
"Utilisé si l'extension PHP duckdb n'est pas installée. Laisser vide pour "
"autodétection."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:5
msgid "MotherDuck"
msgstr "MotherDuck"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:8
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Token"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:17
msgid ""
"Overridden by the MXCHAT_PLUS_MOTHERDUCK_TOKEN constant in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"Surchargé par la constante MXCHAT_PLUS_MOTHERDUCK_TOKEN définie dans wp-"
"config.php."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:18
msgid ""
"The token defined in wp-config takes precedence over this field; remove the "
"constant to edit the value here."
msgstr ""
"Le token défini dans wp-config a priorité sur ce champ ; supprimez la "
"constante pour pouvoir modifier la valeur ici."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:22
msgid ""
"MotherDuck token (from <a href=\"https://app.motherduck.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">app.motherduck.com</a>). For compliance-"
"driven installs that forbid storing secrets in the database, define "
"<code>MXCHAT_PLUS_MOTHERDUCK_TOKEN</code> in <code>wp-config.php</code> to "
"override this field at runtime."
msgstr ""
"Token MotherDuck (depuis <a href=\"https://app.motherduck.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">app.motherduck.com</a>). Pour les "
"installations soumises à des contraintes de conformité interdisant de "
"stocker des secrets en base, définissez <code>MXCHAT_PLUS_MOTHERDUCK_TOKEN</"
"code> dans <code>wp-config.php</code> pour surcharger ce champ à l'exécution."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:31
msgid "Database"
msgstr "Base de données"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:39
msgid "Local mirror"
msgstr "Miroir local"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:45
msgid ""
"Maintain a local DuckDB shadow with HNSW for fast reads (recommended for > "
"100k vectors)"
msgstr ""
"Maintenir une copie locale DuckDB avec HNSW pour des lectures rapides "
"(recommandé au-delà de 100 000 vecteurs)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:48
msgid ""
"When enabled, writes are mirrored to a local `.duckdb` file and queries run "
"there for HNSW acceleration. MotherDuck remains the canonical store. The "
"initial bootstrap runs in the background via Action Scheduler — watch the "
"status panel below for progress."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque l'option est active, les écritures sont répliquées dans un fichier "
"`.duckdb` local et les requêtes y sont exécutées pour bénéficier de "
"l'accélération HNSW. MotherDuck reste le stockage de référence. L'amorçage "
"initial s'exécute en arrière-plan via Action Scheduler — suivez sa "
"progression dans le panneau d'état ci-dessous."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:69
msgid "Mirror status:"
msgstr "État du miroir :"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:80
#, php-format
msgid "Progress: %1$d / %2$d (%3$d%%)"
msgstr "Progression : %1$d / %2$d (%3$d %%)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:90
#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:35
msgid "Last error:"
msgstr "Dernière erreur :"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:99
msgid ""
"Drift detected between MotherDuck and local. Run <code>wp mxchat-plus mirror-"
"bootstrap --reset</code> to re-converge, or investigate via <code>wp mxchat-"
"plus mirror-drift-check</code>."
msgstr ""
"Dérive détectée entre MotherDuck et le miroir local. Lancez <code>wp mxchat-"
"plus mirror-bootstrap --reset</code> pour reconverger, ou diagnostiquez avec "
"<code>wp mxchat-plus mirror-drift-check</code>."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:110
#, php-format
msgid "Pending writes queued: %d"
msgstr "Écritures en attente dans la file : %d"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "Quarantined entries: %d"
msgstr "Entrées en quarantaine : %d"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "Last drift check: %s ago"
msgstr "Dernière vérification de dérive : il y a %s"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:129
msgid "Last drift check: never (the daily cron has not run yet)"
msgstr ""
"Dernière vérification de dérive : jamais (le cron quotidien n'a pas encore "
"tourné)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:138
msgid "Mirror path"
msgstr "Chemin du miroir"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-motherduck.php:145
msgid ""
"Path to the local mirror `.duckdb` file. Leave empty for the default under "
"uploads/mxchat-plus-private/. Point at a fast local disk if uploads/ is on a "
"network mount."
msgstr ""
"Chemin du fichier `.duckdb` du miroir local. Laissez vide pour utiliser "
"l'emplacement par défaut sous uploads/mxchat-plus-private/. Pointez vers un "
"disque local rapide si uploads/ est monté sur le réseau."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:5
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Performance"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:12
msgid ""
"Cache top-K results (keyed by embedding hash + filter + bot). Invalidated "
"automatically on upsert/delete."
msgstr ""
"Mettre en cache les résultats top-K (clé : hash de l'embedding + filtre + "
"bot). Invalidation automatique à chaque upsert/suppression."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:17
msgid "Cache TTL (seconds)"
msgstr "TTL du cache (secondes)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:25
msgid "Slow-query threshold (ms)"
msgstr "Seuil de requête lente (ms)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-performance.php:30
msgid ""
"Queries slower than this are written to the PHP error log. Set to 0 to "
"disable."
msgstr ""
"Les requêtes plus lentes que ce seuil sont consignées dans le journal "
"d'erreurs PHP. Mettez 0 pour désactiver."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:5
msgid "Retrieval quality"
msgstr "Qualité de la recherche"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:8
msgid "Hybrid BM25 + vector"
msgstr "BM25 hybride + vectoriel"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:12
msgid ""
"Blend BM25 full-text scores with vector similarity (requires the DuckDB FTS "
"extension and a populated `mxchat_plus_duckdb_query_text` filter)."
msgstr ""
"Combiner les scores plein texte BM25 avec la similarité vectorielle "
"(nécessite l'extension FTS de DuckDB et un filtre "
"`mxchat_plus_duckdb_query_text` renseigné)."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:17
msgid "Hybrid α (vector weight)"
msgstr "α hybride (poids du vectoriel)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:22
msgid ""
"1.0 = pure vector, 0.0 = pure BM25. 0.7 is a sensible default for factual "
"KBs."
msgstr ""
"1.0 = vectoriel pur, 0.0 = BM25 pur. 0.7 est une valeur par défaut "
"raisonnable pour une base de connaissances factuelle."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:26
msgid "Dedup per source"
msgstr "Déduplication par source"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:30
msgid ""
"Keep only the highest-scoring chunk per source_url in the top-K (avoids "
"passing N near-duplicate chunks from the same article to the LLM)."
msgstr ""
"Ne conserver que le chunk au meilleur score par source_url dans le top-K "
"(évite d'envoyer au LLM N chunks quasi identiques issus du même article)."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:10
msgid "Vector schema"
msgstr "Schéma vectoriel"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:13
msgid "Embedding dimension"
msgstr "Dimension d'embedding"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:22
#, php-format
msgid ""
"MxChat is currently using dimension %d. This must match the active embedding "
"model."
msgstr ""
"MxChat utilise actuellement une dimension de %d. Doit correspondre au modèle "
"d'embedding actif."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:29
msgid "Custom / Azure OpenAI embeddings detected."
msgstr "Embeddings Custom / Azure OpenAI détectés."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:31
msgid ""
"MxChat is embedding through a custom provider, whose output dimension is not "
"in any registry — the number above is a placeholder. Probe your endpoint to "
"fill in the real value, then Save."
msgstr ""
"MxChat génère les embeddings via un fournisseur personnalisé, dont la "
"dimension de sortie n'est dans aucun registre — le nombre ci-dessus est un "
"espace réservé. Sondez votre point de terminaison pour renseigner la vraie "
"valeur, puis Enregistrez."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:36
msgid "Detect dimension"
msgstr "Détecter la dimension"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:44
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "Métrique"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:51
msgid ""
"MxChat uses cosine similarity — keep cosine unless you have a specific "
"reason."
msgstr ""
"MxChat utilise la similarité cosinus — gardez cosine sauf cas spécifique."

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:55
msgid "HNSW index"
msgstr "Index HNSW"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:59
msgid ""
"Create an HNSW index over the embedding column (recommended for > 10k "
"entries)"
msgstr "Créer un index HNSW sur le vecteur (recommandé pour > 10k entrées)"

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-vector-schema.php:64
msgid "Default top-K"
msgstr "Top-K par défaut"

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:24
msgid "MxChat — DuckDB / MotherDuck"
msgstr "MxChat — DuckDB / MotherDuck"

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:28
msgid ""
"Replaces Pinecone with DuckDB (embedded) or MotherDuck (cloud) as the vector "
"store. The plugin registers itself with MxChat as an alternative Pinecone "
"backend."
msgstr ""
"Remplace Pinecone par DuckDB (embedded) ou MotherDuck (cloud) comme vector "
"store. Le plugin s'enregistre auprès de MxChat comme un backend Pinecone "
"alternatif."

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:46
msgid "Performance:"
msgstr "Performance :"

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:48
msgid ""
"the PHP duckdb extension is not loaded. The plugin falls back to the duckdb "
"CLI binary, which adds 50–200 ms of process-spawn latency per query."
msgstr ""
"l'extension PHP duckdb n'est pas chargée. Le plugin retombe sur le binaire "
"duckdb CLI, ce qui ajoute 50–200 ms de latence par requête (lancement de "
"processus)."

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:53
msgid "MotherDuck + CLI mode:"
msgstr "Mode MotherDuck + CLI :"

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:55
msgid ""
"each query re-runs the MotherDuck ATTACH (network handshake + token "
"validation). Expect 1–3 s of overhead per call. For production, install the "
"PECL duckdb extension."
msgstr ""
"chaque requête refait l'ATTACH MotherDuck (handshake réseau + validation du "
"token). Comptez 1–3 s de surcoût par appel. En production, installez "
"l'extension PECL duckdb."

#: admin/views/duckdb/settings.php:76
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrer"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:40
#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:41
#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:53
#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:54
#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:86
msgid "MxChat Plus"
msgstr "MxChat Plus"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:64
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "Modules"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:66
msgid "Vector store"
msgstr "Vector store"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:69
msgid "Prompt cache"
msgstr "Cache de prompts"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:76
msgid "You do not have permission to access this page."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation d’accéder à cette page."

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:122
msgid ""
"Each module works on its own. Turning one off stops it from loading entirely "
"— its settings and data are left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Chaque module fonctionne indépendamment. En désactiver un l’empêche "
"totalement de se charger — ses réglages et ses données restent intacts."

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:153
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Environnement"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:159
msgid "MxChat version"
msgstr "Version de MxChat"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:160
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "inconnue"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:167
msgid "MxChat streaming"
msgstr "Streaming MxChat"

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:169
msgid "On — prompt caching cannot apply to the main chat."
msgstr ""
"Activé — la mise en cache des prompts ne peut pas s’appliquer au chat "
"principal."

#: includes/core/class-mxchat-plus-admin.php:170
msgid ""
"Streaming responses are sent with curl_exec, which bypasses the WordPress "
"HTTP API, so no filter can reach them. Turn streaming off in MxChat settings "
"to cache the main chat."
msgstr ""
"Les réponses en streaming sont envoyées via curl_exec, qui contourne l’API "
"HTTP de WordPress : aucun filtre ne peut donc les atteindre. Désactivez le "
"streaming dans les réglages de MxChat pour mettre en cache le chat principal."

